span class=\"label\">Docker Desktop</span><span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"side-item\"><span class=\"label\">Docker Engine</span><span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"side-item\"><span class=\"label\">Docker Offload</span><span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"side-item\"><span class=\"label\">Docker Build</span><span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"side-item\"><span class=\"label\">Docker Build Cloud</span><span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"side-item\"><span class=\"label\">Docker Compose</span><span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"side-item\"><span class=\"label\">Docker Extensions</span><span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"side-item\"><span class=\"label\">Deprecated products and features</span></div>\n        <div class=\"side-item\"><span class=\"label\">Release lifecycle</span></div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"side-section\">\n        <div class=\"side-title\">SUPPLY CHAIN SECURITY</div>\n        <div class=\"side-item\"><span class=\"label\">Docker Hardened Images <span class=\"badge new\">New</span></span><span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"side-item\"><span class=\"label\">Docker Hub</span><span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"side-item\"><span class=\"label\">Docker Scout</span><span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"side-section\">\n        <div class=\"side-title\">PLATFORM</div>\n        <div class=\"side-item\"><span class=\"label\">Support</span></div>\n        <div class=\"side-item\"><span class=\"label\">Billing</span><span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"side-item\"><span class=\"label\">Docker accounts</span><span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"side-item\"><span class=\"label\">Security</span><span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"side-item\"><span class=\"label\">Subscription</span><span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"side-item\"><span class=\"label\">Release notes</span></div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"side-section\">\n        <div class=\"side-title\">ENTERPRISE</div>\n        <div class=\"side-item\"><span class=\"label\">Administration</span><span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"side-item\"><span class=\"label\">Deploy Docker Desktop</span><span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"side-item\"><span class=\"label\">Security</span><span class=\"chevron\">⌃</span></div>\n        <div class=\"side-item indent\"><span class=\"label\">Add and manage domains</span></div>\n        <div class=\"side-item indent\"><span class=\"label\">Single sign-on</span><span class=\"chevron\">⌃</span></div>\n        <div class=\"side-item deep\"><span class=\"label\">Setup</span></div>\n        <div class=\"side-item deep\"><span class=\"label\">Manage connections</span></div>\n        <div class=\"side-item deep selected\"><span class=\"label\">Troubleshoot</span></div>\n        <div class=\"side-item deep\"><span class=\"label\">FAQs</span><span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"side-item indent\"><span class=\"label\">Provision</span><span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"side-item indent\"><span class=\"label\">Enforce sign-in</span><span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"side-item indent\"><span class=\"label\">Roles and permissions</span><span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"side-item indent\"><span class=\"label\">Hardened Docker Desktop</span><span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"side-item indent\"><span class=\"label\">Organization access tokens</span></div>\n      </section>\n    </aside>\n\n    <main class=\"main\">\n      <div class=\"breadcrumbs\">\n        Home&nbsp; / &nbsp;Manuals&nbsp; / &nbsp;Security&nbsp; / &nbsp;Single sign-on&nbsp; / &nbsp;<span>Troubleshoot</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <h1>Troubleshoot single sign-on</h1>\n\n      <div class=\"tools\">\n        <span class=\"gordon\">Ask Gordon</span>\n        <span class=\"copy\">Copy Markdown</span>\n        <span class=\"markdown\">View Markdown</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <p>This page describes common single sign-on (SSO) errors and their solutions. Issues can stem from your identity provider (IdP) configuration or Docker settings.</p>\n\n      <h2>Check for errors</h2>\n      <p>If you experience SSO issues, check both Docker and your identity provider for errors first.</p>\n\n      <h3>Check Docker error logs</h3>\n      <ol>\n        <li>Sign in to <span style=\"color:#5782d5;\">Docker Home</span> and select your organization from the top-left account drop-down.</li>\n        <li>Select <strong>Admin Console</strong>, then <strong>SSO and SCIM</strong>.</li>\n        <li>In the SSO connections table, select the <strong>Action</strong> menu and then <strong>View error logs</strong>.</li>\n        <li>For more details on specific errors, select <strong>View error details</strong> next to an error message.</li>\n        <li>Note any errors you see on this page for further troubleshooting.</li>\n      </ol>\n\n      <h3>Check identity provider errors</h3>\n      <ol>\n        <li>Review your IdP’s logs or audit trails for any failed authentication or provisioning attempts.</li>\n        <li>Confirm that your IdP’s SSO settings match the values provided in Docker.</li>\n        <li>If applicable, confirm that you have configured user provisioning correctly and that it is enabled in your IdP.</li>\n        <li>If applicable, verify that your IdP correctly maps Docker's required user attributes.</li>\n        <li>Try provisioning a test user from your IdP and verify if they appear in Docker.</li>\n      </ol>\n\n      <p>For further troubleshooting, check your IdP's documentation or contact their support team.</p>\n\n      <h2>Groups are not formatted correctly</h2>\n\n      <h3>Error message</h3>\n      <p>When this issue occurs, the following error message is common:</p>\n\n      <div class=\"code-block\">Some of the groups assigned to the user are not formatted as '&lt;organization&gt;:&lt;team&gt;'.</div>\n\n      <h3>Causes</h3>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Incorrect group name formatting in your identity provider (IdP): Docker requires groups to follow the format <code>&lt;organization&gt;:&lt;team&gt;</code>. If the groups assigned to a user do not follow this format, they will be ignored.</li>\n        <li>Non-matching groups between IdP and Docker organization: If a group in your IdP does not have a corresponding team in Docker, it will not be recognized, and the user will be placed in the default organization and team.</li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <h3>Affected environments</h3>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Docker single sign-on setup using IdPs such as Okta or Azure AD</li>\n      </ul>\n    </main>\n\n    <aside class=\"toc\">\n      <div class=\"toc-links\">\n        <div>Edit this page</div>\n        <div>Request changes</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"toc-title\">Table of contents</div>\n      <div class=\"toc-list\">\n        <div class=\"current\">Check for errors</div>\n        <div>Groups are not formatted correctly</div>\n        <div>User is not assigned to the organization</div>\n        <div>IdP-initiated sign in is not enabled for connection</div>\n        <div>Not enough seats in organization</div>\n        <div>Domain is not verified for SSO connection</div>\n        <div>Unable to find session</div>\n        <div>Name ID is not an email address</div>\n      </div>\n    </aside>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"position:fixed; right:40px; bottom:0; background:#1474d1; color:#fff; padding:12px 20px; border-radius:7px 7px 0 0; font-size:16px;\">\n    ▣&nbsp;&nbsp;Give feedback\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
